menu "Firmware update strategy"
    config SINGLE_APP_USB_ENABLE
        bool "Single factory application; USB firmware updates and recovery"
        default y
        help
            Use partitions.single.csv: one factory app spanning the former
            A/B region. Wi-Fi TCP REPL remains independent. No network firmware
            update, HTTPS status server or bootloader application rollback.
            Preserve NVS and the old OTA control bytes as reserved data.
            Building is not permission to change a device partition table.
            Disable only for explicit historical dual-slot regression builds.
    config OTA_SERVICE_ENABLE
        bool "Legacy dual-slot regression: authenticated HTTPS application OTA"
        depends on WIFI_SERVICE_CONNECT_ENABLE && BOARD_DISPLAY_ENABLE && SPIRAM
        default n
        help
            Historical regression only; disable SINGLE_APP_USB_ENABLE.
            Requires separately approved dual-slot layout and rollback bootloader.
            Private token/TLS files are embedded via CMake, not sdkconfig.
            Never enables NVS or eFuses.
endmenu
